# The deployment images build the reactor inside the builder stage, so the context needs the
# sources and nothing a previous local build produced. Without this file a developer's target/
# trees are copied in, and `COPY target/tesseraql-cli-*.jar` then matches both the thin jar and
# a stale shaded one — two copies of the framework on one classpath, and an image whose contents
# depend on what the machine happened to have built.
target/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
docs-site/node_modules/
docs-site/dist/
editor/node_modules/
editor/*.vsix
**/work/
*.log
